     1,
     "Hi Vincent, <div><br></div><div>Thanks for your response.  I&#39;m in the process of seeking ethics approval for release of information.  Once obtained, I&#39;ll update you here.  Thank you for your patience.</div><div><br></div><div>Best regards,</div><div>Susie<br><br></div>"
